CHMahjong
Copyright 2026 bateske

From CHChess (https://github.com/bateske/CHChess) and CHBlackjack
(https://github.com/bateske/CHBlackjack), both Apache-2.0: the input and
frame pacing (src/CHGame.*), palette, drawing, outlined lettering, effects,
sound sequencer, flash saving, debug protocol, the pointing glove's art and
the PC simulator and tools, adapted here. CHBlackjack is a derivative of
"Blackjack" for the Arduboy by Press Play On Tape (Apache-2.0); the 3x5
pixel font in src/gfx/Draw.cpp is Press Play On Tape's.

Everything else - the board logic and its deals, the layouts, the tile art,
the game flow and the presentation - is new, under the Apache License 2.0
(LICENSE).
